Package: livetennisapi
Title: Client for the 'Live Tennis API'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Synapse Research Ltd", email = "hello@livetennisapi.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Live Tennis API", role = "cph"))
Description: Read live and historical tennis data from the 'Live Tennis API'
    <https://livetennisapi.com> into R. Covers live scores, fixtures,
    players, tournaments, rankings, head-to-head records and the 1968 to
    2022 results archive, for the ATP, WTA, Challenger and ITF tours. List
    endpoints return tibbles.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://livetennisapi.com, https://docs.livetennisapi.com,
    https://github.com/livetennisapi/livetennisapi-r
BugReports: https://github.com/livetennisapi/livetennisapi-r/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.1.0),
    stats,
    tibble (>= 3.0.0),
    utils
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
